:[],"hidden_lines":[]},"en":{"label":"English","title":"Deep Slumber","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["We still lie sleeping","in your lap, Mother,","yet sleep does not come.","Why are you so silent, Mother,","why do you not sing a lullaby?"],["What has happened","to those laughing flowers?","Where have those butterflies gone?","Your earth is drenched in blood—","whose wrongs are these?"],["You alone gave us birth,","we are your children.","But look at our fate:","we ourselves are your regrets,","we ourselves your sorrows!"],["The scream from Gaza's lanes,","the helplessness of stricken Ukraine,","the lament of Murshidabad","speak","the reason for your silence!"],["We will keep sleeping without a care,","in deep sleep,","but our eyes will be open,","and perhaps your silence","will continue","forever!"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"or":{"label":"ଓଡ଼ିଆ","title":"ସୁଷୁପ୍ତି","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["ଆମେ ଏବେ ବି ଶୋଇଛୁ,","ତୁମ କୋଳରେ ମାଆ,","କିନ୍ତୁ ନିଦ ଆସୁନି।","ତୁମେ ଏତେ ଚୁପ୍ କାହିଁକି ମାଆ,","ନାନାବାୟା ବି ଗାଉନାହଁ?"],["କ'ଣ ହୋଇଗଲା,","ସେ ଖିଲିଖିଲି ହସୁଥିବା ଫୁଲଙ୍କର?","କୁଆଡ଼େ ଗଲେ ସେ ପ୍ରଜାପତିମାନେ?","ରକ୍ତରେ ଲହୁଲୁହାଣ ତୁମ ମାଟି,","କାହାର ଏ ଭୁଲ୍?"],["ତୁମେ ହିଁ ଆମକୁ ଜନ୍ମ ଦେଇଛ,","ତୁମରି ସନ୍ତାନ ଆମେ।","କିନ୍ତୁ ଭାଗ୍ୟ ଦେଖ,","ଆମେ ହିଁ ତୁମ ଅନୁତାପ,","ଆମେ ହିଁ ତୁମ ଦୁଃଖ!"],["ଗାଜାର ଗଳିର ଚିତ୍କାର,","ତ୍ରସ୍ତ ୟୁକ୍ରେନ୍‌ର ଅସହାୟତା,","ମୁର୍ଶିଦାବାଦର ଆର୍ତ୍ତନାଦ,","କହିଦିଏ,","ତୁମ ନୀରବତାର କାରଣ!"],["ଆମେ ନିର୍ଭୟରେ ଶୋଇରହିବୁ,","ଗଭୀର ନିଦରେ,","କିନ୍ତୁ ଆଖି ଖୋଲା ଥିବ,","ଆଉ ହୁଏତ ତୁମ ନୀରବତା,","ଜାରି ରହିବ,","ସବୁଦିନ ପାଇଁ!"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]}},"end_mark":"sprig","author":"Dilip Mohapatra","route":"poem-614.html","portrait":"assets/writers/23-earth-voice-v1-64.webp","illustration":{"src":"assets/section-art/reading-room-poetic-natural.webp","alt":"An open notebook lies on a blue bench beside still water.","width":1536,"height":1024},"availability":""},{"id":602,"source_language":"en","variants":{"en":{"label":"English","title":"LOST AND FOUND","kind":"Original","stanzas":[["There was a time","when passions subsided","like tides do","but soon they returned","but now when they retreat","they never come back."],["There was a time","when you were thrilled","to hear the mindless encore","of the claque","but now the hall is empty","and the crow`s feet around","the corners of your eyes","can`t be hidden with","any make up."],["A time comes","when your well wishers","ask you about your health","and your children insist on","booking the wheelchair for you","at the airport","when you rock on your recliner","on your balcony","vacantly looking at an empty sky","and feel that the emptiness within","mirrors that outside..."],["You wonder","what has really changed","what have you lost","along the way","and when you attempt a U turn","even down the memory lane","you get lost","in the meandering maze."],["It takes some time","to realise that perhaps","it`s your youth","that has given you the slip","like sands of time","leaking through your","loose grip and","limp fingers."],["You try your best","to look in every nook and corner","if you may retrieve it","once again","and someone says","age is just a number-","think young to stay young","but you know","that`s just a cliche","and doesn`t really help."],["Then you receive an invite","from your old buddies","your batch mates","from your academy days","for a reunion","a get-together","in a remote island resort","and you gladly accept","and join them there","and as you meet and greet","and hug one another","in the exuberance","of the boisterous laughters","you rediscover and","find what you thought","was lost forever!"]],"inline_breaks":[],"hidden_lines":[]},"hi":{"label":"हिन्दी","title":"खोया और पाया","kind":"Translation","stanzas":[["एक समय था","जब आवेग उतरते थे","जैसे ज्वार उतरता है","पर जल्द ही लौट आते थे","पर अब जब वे पीछे हटते हैं","कभी वापस नहीं आते।"],["एक समय था","जब तुम रोमांचित होते थे","उस बेसोचे दोहराने के शोर को सुनकर","जो भाड़े के प्रशंसकों से उठता था","पर अब सभागार खाली है","और तुम्हारी आँखों के","कोनों पर पड़ी झुर्रिया